{
  "category": "Iron Ball Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Instead of blood, a powerful magnetic force courses throughout BELDUM’s body. This POKéMON communicates with others by sending controlled pulses of magnetism.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "BELDUM keeps itself floating by generating a magnetic force that repels earth’s natural magnetism. When it sleeps, this POKéMON anchors itself to a cliff using the hooks on its rear.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "When BELDUM gather in a swarm, they move in perfect unison as if they were but one POKéMON. They communicate with each other using brain waves.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It uses magnetic waves to converse with its kind. All the cells in its body are magnetic.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "It uses magnetic waves to converse with its kind. All the cells in its body are magnetic.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
